---
epr-meta-version: 1
id: workspace-lifecycle-bridge
covers: subtree
purpose: >
  Translate declared workspace environment endpoints, initially Eclipse Che, for elohim-node.
  Discovery is not route creation or authorization. Generic service attachment belongs to the
  peer host and doorway ingress; this library never weakens loopback-only admission.
---

The local-view launcher's workspace origin is the working precedent. This adapter only reads
explicitly provided configuration. It never reads arbitrary environment variables, invents an
ingress, invokes kubectl or introduces a process supervisor. The host scopes the service map.
